    "detailed_description": "<br><br>Somewhere in France, in an ordinary suburb near Paris, in an ordinary apartment, with ordinary people in an ordinary situation. Johnny and Marianne watch <br>their very popular reality TV show &quot;Les Parisiens sont dans le pr\u00e9&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/1d03da7ae1ee8dd9a57c498b010e1f96.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br>Johnny is away and you receive a mysterious message from a certain F. Voltaire<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/c0bcfbd25ec5ad219b8bfc928a0680e2.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/f94becd2d9d8cd4922caf7f61f754e28.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br><i>Savages do not think of killing themselves out of disgust for life; it is a refinement of intellectual people. We await you in the corridors of supreme knowledge.<br>F. Voltaire.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/acb34f863b3ec470e788428a868af2cd.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br><strong>It's too much, he's going to take a lot of it!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><br>You face your opponents with your bare hands and your martial arts skills will be essential to you. Advance in your investigation and through your encounters to discover where Johnny is hiding.<br><br>The story takes place in our time, French culture is present. Reference to writers and works which serve as mental torture in French schools. But also discover French habits, with the national sport of strikes and blockades, just to say \u201cNO, I don\u2019t want to!\u201d. Public transport is at its best when it works. You will navigate luxurious neighborhoods with 4-star trash cans, filthy hyper-hyped streets, with nice people who are drugged, alcoholic or simply stupid.<br><br>As the Great General de Gaulle said: \u201cFrance cannot be France without greatness.\u201d<br><br>Through all the commotion, distribution of slaps, with exploded skulls, will you manage to find Johnny, kidnap him. It's Voltaire's fault again, REVOLUTION!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><br>Somewhere in France, in an ordinary suburb near Paris, in an ordinary apartment, with ordinary people in an ordinary situation. Johnny and Marianne watch <br>their very popular reality TV show &quot;Les Parisiens sont dans le pr\u00e9&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/1d03da7ae1ee8dd9a57c498b010e1f96.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br>Johnny is away and you receive a mysterious message from a certain F. Voltaire<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/c0bcfbd25ec5ad219b8bfc928a0680e2.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/f94becd2d9d8cd4922caf7f61f754e28.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br><i>Savages do not think of killing themselves out of disgust for life; it is a refinement of intellectual people. We await you in the corridors of supreme knowledge.<br>F. Voltaire.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2730060/extras/acb34f863b3ec470e788428a868af2cd.avif?t=1718914873\" width=612 height=612 /></span><br><br><strong>It's too much, he's going to take a lot of it!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game</strong></h2><br>You face your opponents with your bare hands and your martial arts skills will be essential to you. Advance in your investigation and through your encounters to discover where Johnny is hiding.<br><br>The story takes place in our time, French culture is present. Reference to writers and works which serve as mental torture in French schools. But also discover French habits, with the national sport of strikes and blockades, just to say \u201cNO, I don\u2019t want to!\u201d. Public transport is at its best when it works. You will navigate luxurious neighborhoods with 4-star trash cans, filthy hyper-hyped streets, with nice people who are drugged, alcoholic or simply stupid.<br><br>As the Great General de Gaulle said: \u201cFrance cannot be France without greatness.\u201d<br><br>Through all the commotion, distribution of slaps, with exploded skulls, will you manage to find Johnny, kidnap him. It's Voltaire's fault again, REVOLUTION!",
